        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="dfd_legend" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-family:&apos;Segoe UI&apos;,Roboto,Helvetica,sans-serif;height:100%;background:#ffffff;border-radius:8px;border:2px solid #6366f1;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);&quot;&gt;
        &lt;div style=&quot;background:#4f46e5;color:#ffffff;padding:6px 10px;font-weight:700;font-size:12px;text-align:center;&quot;&gt;
          💡 DFD LEVEL 1 GUIDE
        &lt;/div&gt;
        &lt;div style=&quot;padding:10px;font-size:10.5px;color:#334155;line-height:1.45;&quot;&gt;
          • &lt;b&gt;Square Box&lt;/b&gt;: External Actor (who interacts with system)&lt;br&gt;
          • &lt;b&gt;Rounded Box&lt;/b&gt;: Process (system action or function)&lt;br&gt;
          • &lt;b&gt;Brackets (D1-D5)&lt;/b&gt;: Data Store (saved records in DB)&lt;br&gt;
          • &lt;b&gt;Labeled Arrow&lt;/b&gt;: Data Flow (information travelling between components)
        &lt;/div&gt;
